      "content": "it's not just \"failing\" at a job or a class. it's everything. i feel like i've fundamentally broken the promise i made to them. everything i do just makes the shame worse. i feel like if i just disappeared, the shame wouldn't have to follow them anymore. wouldn't it be easier for everyone if i just wasn't around to mess things up?",
